      "message": "we really want to invalidate any \"cached\" notion of configured\nspeed. this is called at init time or when a base clock has changed.\n\nwe do not use this value to set the port speed registers.\nit is only used to answer a port speed query.\na freq of 0 maps to i2c_freq.I2C_FREQ_COUNT which\ncallers of i2c_get_freq() can use to error-check.\n\nalso, the only case setting the freq could fail is the case where\nwe have an invalid i2c port number or controller number, so there\u0027s\nno associated freq to worry about.",
